.TH DANBY-LOWTHRUST 1
.SH NAME
danby-lowthrust \- continuous low-thrust orbital transfer
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/lowthrust
.SH MODEL
Central gravity is combined with a small continuously steered acceleration.
Prograde thrust spirals outward, retrograde thrust spirals inward, and steering
offset creates non-tangential transfers.
.SH SOURCE
